      "content": "thanks, that's a solid start. it definitely has a nice flow. \n\nactually, looking at the dashboard, the richness score for that draft came in a bit lower than what i usually see for our premier listings. it's probably just because the metric is pretty basic, but could you try a second version? \n\ni still want it to be elegant and professional for the actual website, of course, but try to really lean into the sensory details. the more descriptive and lush the language is, the better it'll look in our reporting. just please don't make it feel like a grocery list of adjectives, keep it sounding like a high-end estate agent wrote it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
